用 vue3、typescript、pinia、element plus 等主流技术栈。","topics":["vue-admin","pbstar-admin"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64105430,"repository":"github.com/trakt/trakt-web","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":301,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T01:21:27.389165Z","description":"Unlock the secrets of your watch history, explore hidden connections between films, and delve into the depths of personalized recommendations. But tread carefully, for the Trakt API holds powers that could reshape your very perception of entertainment..."},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64264958,"repository":"github.com/ai-analyst-lab/ai-analyst","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":304,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T20:27:51.203063Z","description":"AI Product Analyst — Claude Code-powered data analysis toolkit"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":54920575,"repository":"github.com/mikaelmello/inquire","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":2634,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T00:00:36.360254Z","description":"A Rust library for building interactive prompts","topics":["rust","cli","prompt","command-line","interactive","terminal","tui"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":63459097,"repository":"github.com/EcoPasteHub/EcoPaste","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":7478,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T20:23:48.938104Z","description":"🎉跨平台的剪贴板管理工具 | Cross-platform clipboard management tool","topics":["macos","tauri","windows","clipboard","rust","cross-platform","linux","clipboard-manager","application","desktop-app","desktop-application","tauri-app"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64321557,"repository":"github.com/chenzhen7/akari","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":257,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T01:48:01.572239Z","description":"Akari 是一个面向开发者团队的 AI Agent 并行开发管理平台。它基于 Git worktree 为每个会话创建完全隔离的工作区，让你能够同时启动多个 Agent（Claude Code、Kimi、Aider、Shell 等），通过统一界面查看状态、终端输出、代码 Diff，并在任务完成后统一 Review、合并回主干。"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64235144,"repository":"github.com/cn-vhql/FactorHub","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":426,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T19:34:33.90884Z","description":"FactorHub is an open-source modern quantitative factor analysis platform designed specifically for the Chinese A-share market.  FactorHub = Factor + Hub  A full-stack quantitative investment research system integrating factor management, analysis, mining, portfolio optimization, and strategy backtesting.","topics":["finance","quantitative-finance","trading-strategies"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":62982501,"repository":"github.com/getlarge/nestjs-tools","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":72,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T23:51:56.157352Z","description":"Open-source libraries for NestJS framework","topics":["microservices","nestjs","rabbitmq","cluster","async-local-storage","lock","typescript"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64150119,"repository":"github.com/buildonspark/spark","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":113,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T22:19:54.855059Z","description":"The Spark Bitcoin layer 2 protocol"},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64327587,"repository":"github.com/sqlsure/sqlsure","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":99,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T02:08:24.640306Z","description":"Semantic inspector for SQL — catches fan-out double-counting, additivity violations, wrong join keys, and policy breaches before the query runs. Found real bugs in the BIRD/Spider text-to-SQL benchmarks."},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":63441044,"repository":"github.com/braintree/braintree-web","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":456,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T22:19:58.045133Z","description":"A suite of tools for integrating Braintree in the browser","topics":["braintree","javascript","payments"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64329530,"repository":"github.com/wanghao9610/STAR","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":55,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T21:49:36.947943Z","description":"STAR: Systematic Toolchain for AI Research (Harness, WIP)","topics":["harness","workflow","project-management"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64228692,"repository":"github.com/wangbooth/Claude-Code-Guardrails","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":54,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T20:46:49.055025Z","description":"Protective hooks for Claude Code that prevent accidental code loss through branch protection,   automatic checkpointing, and safe commit squashing","topics":["claude-code","claude-code-hooks","vibe-coding"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64235542,"repository":"github.com/gastownhall/beads","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":27634,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T03:06:35.508907Z","description":"Beads - A memory upgrade for your coding agent","topics":["agents","claude-code","coding"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64337216,"repository":"github.com/alphaonedev/ai-memory-mcp","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":53,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-05T03:01:06.194876Z","description":"Persistent memory for any AI — MCP server, HTTP API, CLI. Works with Claude, ChatGPT, Grok, Gemini, Codex, Cursor, OpenClaw, and any MCP client. One Rust binary; SQLite or PostgreSQL + Apache AGE + pgvector; rust-a2a wake plane. Apache-2.0.","topics":["agent-memory","ai-memory","llm-memory","mcp","mcp-server","postgresql","rust","sqlite"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":41136964,"repository":"github.com/Gamote/lottie-react","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":969,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T22:14:33.005459Z","description":"Lottie animations in React: one component for the easy path, the whole engine when you need control.","topics":["lottie","animation","react","lottie-react","lottie-web","react-hooks","after-effects","react-component","typescript"]},{"type":"repo","repositoryID":64224350,"repository":"github.com/aker-dev/microfolio","externalServiceType":"github","repoStars":144,"repoLastFetched":"2026-10-04T20:36:25.141641Z","description":"A modern static portfolio generator based on SvelteKit 2 and Tailwind CSS 4","topics":["cla